   Natural Sciences; Seattle University's Summer Faculty Fellowship
   Program, College of Science and Engineering Undergraduate
   Student/Faculty Research Award; Environmental Studies Department;
   Charlotte Grenier},
Funding-Text = {Funding for this project came from the Murdock College Research Program
   for Natural Sciences (grant no. G01821-NP-AAS), Seattle University's
   Summer Faculty Fellowship Program, College of Science and Engineering
   Undergraduate Student/Faculty Research Award, and the Environmental
   Studies Department. Caroline Grandia, Brandon McWilliams, and Emily
